  ok   overhand: dizzy once the reaction ends (DIZZY)
  ok   a dizzy fighter can be hit (no guard)
  ok   each hit drains the stun (59 -> 41)
  ok   after that hit's reaction it is dizzy again (DIZZY)
  ok   a stun move on a dizzy fighter never re-stuns
  ok   a knockdown clears the stun
  ok   recovering grants stun immunity (179)
  ok   a stun move during the immunity does not stun
  ok   a blocked stun move never stuns
